<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-14702] Inconsistency of the new index when the node falls / deactivates</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-14702</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;At the moment, if we add a new index and in the middle of its construction we fall / deactivate a node, then it will be inconsistent and may create errors.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Need to either add a new index to DurableBackgroundTask, or add / modify a separate mechanism that allows to resume the creation of a new index.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
